  "ingredients": [
    "3 large eggs",
    "3 teaspoons Worcestershire sauce",
    "2 cups dry bread crumbs",
    "12 (5.5 ounce) lamb chops"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients and preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gH5uo7l3zYQgXkdQoMONRwN9ViA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-18810-baked-lamb-chops-ddmfs-step1-3x4-13498-e0daf2a85ca74d65a32a4e1991d5158b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18810/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat together eggs and Worcestershire sauce in a shallow bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/w7WhvJG2DeL28WpIwZtjgAfS44Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-18810-baked-lamb-chops-ddmfs-step2-3x4-13500-b6b01ac0b6b7403d9b66aece4f611916.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18810/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place bread crumbs in a second shallow bowl. Dip each lamb chop in egg mixture, then lightly dredge in bread crumbs to coat. Arrange lamb chops in a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tdFpCO9RUyfTQGuAJWaxNMHNLRg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-18810-baked-lamb-chops-ddmfs-step3-3x4-13506-58b405b0545241049bcaac2cf59c8f9a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18810/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 20 minutes. Turn lamb chops over and continue cooking to desired doneness, about 20 more minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center of chops should read 130 degrees F (55 degrees C) for medium doneness.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
